  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Southeast Asia Maritime Consultancy 2.0</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Second Phase of Southeast Asia Regional Maritime Consultancy Work. This body of work aims to support partners in Southeast Asia to improve their ability to lawfully and effectively manage their maritime domains. 

The program is being implemented across three streams:
1. Legal and Regulatory
2. Coordination and Governance
3. Non Government Engagement</narrative>
  </description>
